 CBCoordProp msg;n;r
⍝ DemoCoordProp: Report writes eWG Posn,Size of each object into F1.OUT as
⍝ name=y x h w|...; Grow resizes the Group (its Prop children should follow)
 :Select ⊃⌽'.'(≠⊆⊢)⊃msg
 :Case 'REPORT'
     r←''
     :For n :In 'F1' 'F1.G' 'F1.G.B' 'F1.G.PX' 'F1.SF' 'F1.SF.L'
         r,←n,'=',(⍕∊n eWG'Posn' 'Size'),'|'
     :EndFor
     'F1.OUT'eWS'Caption'(¯1↓r)
 :Case 'GROW'
     'F1.G'eWS'Size'(55 50)
 :EndSelect
